{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "34d4c3a28e20a494a6cb2d0c493894cb6ccae2e2a5919b9fa05038bcdd74f267", "ja": "審判、そして……", "zh": "审判，然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "10dbcd6ddb597a1d26ccb507fbccc1a5e16e6d4a307d7fa2940c2ac2c92d6ada", "ja": "激しい戦いの中、春香は自分が『陰界の王』\nであることを思い出し、世界は陰界化する。\n始まる審判……そしてやよいも失われた記憶\nと、ジュリアとの絆を取り戻す。その一撃を\n受け、春香は満足げに消え去るのだった。", "zh": "在激烈的战斗中，春香想起自己是“阴界之王”，\n世界也随之化为阴界。\n审判开始……而弥生也取回了失去的记忆\n以及与茱莉亚之间的羁绊。承受了那一击后，\n春香心满意足地消失了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "31b4a24aae5707099c1a468b2076b215370427a2fa9b6a605ed0e39812fbdd63", "ja": "―忘れられた街―", "zh": "―被遗忘的街区―", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "f4b3d12d52f3878bf1ed33d29d05b10b7641c8b10c71c5a40d3a80489df4954c", "ja": "ジュリアちゃん。今まであなたは、戦具の能力を\n隠したまま逃げ延びてきた。まったく、お見事だわ。", "zh": "茱莉亚。一直以来，你都隐藏着战具的能力，成功逃到了现在。真是漂亮啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "4923df0212f542fea419b1a10cdcb991b5ffafdc2df2e8a95ed3c4e55ec08e46", "ja": "でも、推理することはできる。あなたは深青の\n全データを瞬時に改ざんし、忽然と姿を消した……。", "zh": "不过，我还是能推理出来的。你瞬间篡改了深青的全部数据，然后突然消失了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "9449ad6585e7f079e3131da52fe34c7e12629d5723a3df60fb1a667c61966b39", "ja": "そして今、のり子ちゃんへの攻撃で確信したわ。\nあなたの戦具は時間操作系、自分を加速するタイプね？", "zh": "而现在，通过你对诺里子发动的攻击，我就确定了。你的战具属于时间操控系，是加速自身的类型，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "d0e5bc81020ef5cedcbc42402757fa515aca07ba88c6c408549d0aed262a015c", "ja": "さすがだな、このみ姉。ほぼ正解だよ。\nけど、一つ間違えてる……", "zh": "不愧是这个姬，基本猜对了。\n不过，有一点说错了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "6acdd91e8cd12b89aa3a56fedf00ebb380c9e6517cc703732a3f9e99c86bf4fc", "ja": "あたしは別に隠してない。\n誰もあたしの速さを見切れなかっただけだ。", "zh": "我又没特意隐瞒。\n只是没人能看穿我的速度而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "868f7a71ec8f23fcbc98bd8c105d85ddd63eb12e9e46416771f01c5b30af335f", "ja": "なっ！？　速っ……！", "zh": "什么！？好快……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1007_se", "source_sha256": "4a7384cf0f31bad47cbbbb52a7b3396893c58fcd42bc865920c5cae674a3ee81", "ja": "ドゴォッ！", "zh": "咚轰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "372a8711b9adea1d998fdbd617e3b0a95b56a413cb625e0fe368aef0c348acb2", "ja": "ぐっ、うぅ……ああ……あ……！\n……。", "zh": "呜、呜呜……啊……啊……！\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "f99e881cd33e5ca1048d62751b3e8600ab33a8131c5913d2affd890fcb2abefc", "ja": "は、春香さん！？　大丈夫ですか、春香さん！", "zh": "春、春香姐！？你没事吧，春香姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "6b8453dc40cb47eb663db983215ae75b1eba6363f09ed2a6a878633490d15778", "ja": "や、よい……ああ……ごめん、ね。\n私、思い出しちゃった……私は、いつも眠ってて……", "zh": "亚、弥……啊……对不、起。\n我想起来了……我，总是在沉睡着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "80c2d21c853d20c8c5bffd6e0ed77971dc46c079a521615aad41e6d547f09a3f", "ja": "こうやって、その時が来たら、\n無意識の海から浮上して……本当の私になるの。", "zh": "就这样，到了那个时候，\n我会从无意识的海洋中浮现出来……成为真正的我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "446a7c13fec254cfd18b286f5208433e3257bb6bd8d29b188b84204b396e0c14", "ja": "え……春香さん？", "zh": "诶……春香前辈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "854c33c27af8aa617d713c725d802fe37ceed8687b1d65db50d0c26448fbad8b", "ja": "ねえ、やよい……この人生は、楽しかった？\n……星の光を超えて輝け、『ザ・ティアラ』。", "zh": "喂，弥生……这一生，过得开心吗？\n……超越星光闪耀吧，《The Tiara》。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1014_se", "source_sha256": "7ee28857313104ee3a7319eb9988d5884eb1633bfe1a13fea0a210b5db3d12cf", "ja": "ブーーーーーーーーッ！！！！", "zh": "嘟——————！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1015_audience", "source_sha256": "e11ae7dcfecef3f7dea78b6006d591581ee28e30a95d1738118b4ef6f5f11fe5", "ja": "ワアアアァァァァァァァーッ！！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1016_mc", "source_sha256": "b0e5228bea8be0d46cdbf3faa7c3532e3db924bf3919b25531fbf4464e86af75", "ja": "レディース、アンド、ジェントルマン！\nお待ちかね『陰界戦戯（シャドウバウト）』の時間だ！", "zh": "女士们，先生们！\n大家久等了，现在是期待已久的《阴界战戯（Shadow Bout）》时间！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "52bca9289e7298133e5920cf004214512a32a12112babff3b1783d9d90e19f3d", "ja": "な、なによこれ！？　陰界化！？\nシャドウバウトは休止中だったはずじゃ……！", "zh": "这、这是什么啊！？阴界化！？  \n《阴界战戯》不是暂停了吗……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1018_001har", "source_sha256": "96889b3b626c203deeed22c6ff58433aa82b65f2278c53c2d6ec141eda40b89c", "ja": "のり子ちゃん、こんにちは。陰界の王、天海春香です。\n私と戦いたかったんだよね？　いいよ、始めよう。", "zh": "法子，午安。我是阴界之王，天海春香。  \n你是想和我战斗吧？好啊，开始吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "3635f260943a4a16ece502642b7e9c8363bd281121330d7defc0fce0c1f54f73", "ja": "アンタが……！？\nどうして急に？　何が目的？", "zh": "是你……！？\n怎么突然这样？你的目的是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1020_001har", "source_sha256": "7851396e55ece159dd922243c764db1d3106370798d87fbf29787bfb99960b72", "ja": "私の役目は、審判。これから『大忘却』を始めます。\nイヤなら、みんなの力を示して。", "zh": "我的职责是审判。接下来，我要开始『大忘却』了。\n不愿意的话，就证明给我看大家的力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "2c2ba4a228319fce77be907f650a01ab55939d6eaf8a4b6def5ec74d13e7b1ff", "ja": "やめろ、ハル！　思い出をオモチャにするな！", "zh": "住手，春！别把回忆当成玩具！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1022_001har", "source_sha256": "449c6d0a06f0f8fbeebf89eb1a3d9d5c6e6009dd83a533627268953f7be19fc1", "ja": "私たちは、オートマチックなんだ。止めたいなら、\n私を倒すしかないよ？　ジュリアちゃん。", "zh": "我们是自动运转的。如果想阻止，\n只有打倒我这一条路哦？　茱莉亚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1023_mc", "source_sha256": "55d7127cbeaf6f884c560a3bcb983b6462623821aefe8bb090a03841cc328d71", "ja": "さあ、ついに我らが王様の登場だ！\n心して見届けよう……シャドウバウト、エンゲージ！", "zh": "来吧，终于轮到我们的王登场了！\n做好心理准备，见证这一刻吧……Shadow Bout，Engage！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1024_audience", "source_sha256": "e11ae7dcfecef3f7dea78b6006d591581ee28e30a95d1738118b4ef6f5f11fe5", "ja": "ワアアアァァァァァァァーッ！！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1025_039kon", "source_sha256": "7f5eb44513e51842a5a722aeeefba391ead4cb6aff7bac311533922dc6da855d", "ja": "ああ、もう……仕方ないわね！　ジュリアちゃん、\n一時休戦よ。共闘といきましょう。", "zh": "唉，真是的……没办法了！茱莉亚，暂时休战。我们联手吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "88fa985fc3c63016862937e54a166c738ad4127533e8bd07237b55e6c1dd22ca", "ja": "あれっ？\nこのみ姉、あっちにつくんじゃないのか？", "zh": "咦？\n木实姐，你不是站在那边的那一派吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1027_039kon", "source_sha256": "f711a933557b975a4f5f7c4347b28c3b3964f85590737e71b984d661ef22ca7e", "ja": "勘違いしないで。『大忘却』を推進しているのは\n深青だけよ。私たち煌聖のお仕事は、秩序を守ること。", "zh": "别误会。推动“大忘却”的只有深青。我们煌聖的职责，是维护秩序。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1028_039kon", "source_sha256": "1f67433bd54e490b37cfd38d3630ff96873c7d646bff008b34c3d06abe1cd158", "ja": "力を示せというのなら、見せてあげましょう……\nいけ、セクシーゴースト！　セクシーラッシュよ！", "zh": "既然你要我展现力量，那就让你见识一下……上吧，性感幽灵！性感连击！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1029_konominosyugorei", "source_sha256": "597c49316f17152410d505f63053f6ba17e8ffa63a0ea03fc242353cbbd619b2", "ja": "シイィィィィィィィィィッ！！", "zh": "希伊————！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1030_se", "source_sha256": "76fb4648a7841b130ffc2d237a2a610fabaaed129a1b2aaa8a2b458c2918bb88", "ja": "ガンッ！　ガンッ！　ガキィンッ！", "zh": "砰！砰！锵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1031_043nor", "source_sha256": "3e4db3cddf8850abe52b89ec5a91f0ca59cc18297673a71f0576dbe7984a408d", "ja": "障壁みたいなのがあるね……このみさんの\nゴーストが効かないなんて、かなりの固さだ。", "zh": "好像有道屏障……连此方小姐的幽灵都不起作用，真是硬得不得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1032_001har", "source_sha256": "ee88e7993584608af6850cd352927c6d916639cde8fce0361b4691ccd2891bcd", "ja": "これが私の、最強の盾。そして……\nやよい、ごめんね。ヴェロチョロ、返してもらうね。", "zh": "这就是我最强的盾牌。接下来……  \n弥生，对不起。我要把维罗奇罗拿回来了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1033_verotyoro", "source_sha256": "ea6455d1d0e8a4dca7ba5569a221b990749f8663716533a38a8a7176f7c06532", "ja": "ヴェロロロロロローッ！", "zh": "嗡噜噜噜噜——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1034_se", "source_sha256": "d09dff04caec1c2644b5e858341a0ef90daebdec4da1e79f5455c800a8794bed", "ja": "バシイィィンッ！", "zh": "啪——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
