{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1036_005yay", "source_sha256": "4ff487ed38f0cee5105e4c1a5fe589621eff50b9401c5dfce8be801e33370411", "ja": "あ……あの、春香さん！　春香さんは、なんで私と\n仲良くしてくれたんですか？　戦具も貸してくれて！", "zh": "啊……那个，春香小姐！春香小姐为什么愿意和我成为好朋友呢？还把战具借给我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1037_001har", "source_sha256": "871937905ea39fd6f0584cbd6477dbd46cfcbc490abcbe7809210de2f3cb294b", "ja": "……。ほっとけなかったんだって、もうひとりの私が。\n普通の女の子になりたいって気持ち、わかるから。", "zh": "……另一个我说，她放心不下你。\n因为她能体会，想要成为普通女孩子的那种心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1038_001har", "source_sha256": "cee629cf68b8706b21639922a6258175919a4c2992a0b5ba039d0f9cceaef6b2", "ja": "覚えてないかもだけど……\nやよいはずっと昔、深青書院の実験体だったんだよ。", "zh": "你可能不记得了……弥生很久以前一直是深青书院的实验体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1039_001har", "source_sha256": "d9bfbeb67d172c6b21c5348a8496166618f36f4b2cad58b8ce05431c460c021c", "ja": "ジュリアちゃんが、命がけで逃がしてくれたんだ。\nだから、やよいは……", "zh": "是茱莉亚拼上性命帮我逃出去的。所以，弥生她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1040_050jul", "source_sha256": "c3da83bc991be23cf95b35eb6e6e15cbf032e2f6e782f0ccd700fff9aeb01d37", "ja": "やめろ、ハル！　おいヤッ……やよい、聞くな！\nでたらめだ！　あたしは自分が逃げたかっただけだ！", "zh": "住手，春！喂，亚……弥生，别听！  \n胡说八道！我只是自己想逃而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1041_005yay", "source_sha256": "08b133544a12dce1ff10f14561a5019edddea9d755e1f9cd2c1156f5ab7d35d6", "ja": "……ジュリアさん？　あ、ああ……！？", "zh": "……茱莉亚？　啊，啊啊……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1042_050jul", "source_sha256": "6b750eaa8669b3976471b3c8acbcefeebfa1f3b30b92656d41889478d192ae34", "ja": "ヤッコ！　あたしのことなんて忘れていい。\nただ、一つだけ約束してくれ……幸せになるって。", "zh": "丫头！忘了我也没关系。只是，答应我一件事……一定要幸福。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1043_se", "source_sha256": "9d5d09bf59eaf8155e606e9b75fe1ccc1f0bc4ee39533ac53bab389291436318", "ja": "ドゴォッ！　メキメキメキッ！", "zh": "咚轰！咔咔咔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
