{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1045_039kon", "source_sha256": "7fd660498dc58b8f1486bd09a0bdf184c7169ed71f91372d25d56cb1cf0cb709", "ja": "ちょっと！　もうセクシーゴーストがもたないわよ！\n早くなんとかしないと……！", "zh": "等等！性感幽灵快撑不住了！\n不赶紧想办法的话……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
