{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1047_043nor", "source_sha256": "745c43dad1bcf8cdd9eeb7c4932244e46bd82ae770e0ef560405d9b1e2dc160f", "ja": "これが、アタシの戦具の能力……\n見逃すなっ、『ジャイアント・キリング』！", "zh": "这就是我的战具能力……  \n可别看漏了！『巨人猎杀』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1048_043nor", "source_sha256": "07ff262deba751f5f89b25cde9138c86bcb3791f786576bbc77bac1b8b1772b6", "ja": "受けたダメージを蓄積して、すっごい一撃を放つんだ！\nだから、手加減なしでお願い！", "zh": "把受到的伤害积累起来，再打出超厉害的一击！\n所以，请不要手下留情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1049_050jul", "source_sha256": "793313203e708f87f85fa53044ed04eb502ebf0c865d6cf2e6e269d8e5742d87", "ja": "なるほどな……わかった。倒れるなよ？\n……光れ、『プラネット・ライナー』！", "zh": "原来如此……明白了。可别倒下啊？\n……闪耀吧，《行星航线》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1050_se", "source_sha256": "720ef7a2cb76abd1ac52a5eccf6b26beb5d56484dbb3a9ec13840c103de4a16a", "ja": "キィィン……ドゴゴゴゴゴゴッ！", "zh": "嗡嗡嗡……轰隆隆隆隆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1051_043nor", "source_sha256": "354d38998627a177bcf8053c0f8451466ff7896f0f01142afb5cba543d024877", "ja": "うぐっ！　ぐはっ！　ガハッ！\n……まだまだーっ！！", "zh": "呃！咳啊！咳咳！\n……还没完呢——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1052_konominosyugorei", "source_sha256": "df37f2d80996bb7cb823c00616c0680d1040fd514fe9863017fea5a16b1e4ed4", "ja": "セ……ク、シ……イィ……", "zh": "性……感……啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
