{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1054_039kon", "source_sha256": "43e6a9c857a03b7409706895568d76fc0a99ec5a3033ecefe3b5203bf6e4037e", "ja": "ああっ、消えちゃった！\n無理させてごめんなさいね、セクシーゴースト……。", "zh": "啊，消失了！\n对不起，勉强你了，性感幽灵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1055_050jul", "source_sha256": "06b7987594ea5d2d7735824c05640fc0e7d102968695f1f68081b3ecd72a0184", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……！　ぐっ……\nあたしの拳の方がイカれちまうぜ……タフすぎだろ！", "zh": "哈啊、哈啊……！唔……\n再打下去，我的拳头都要废了……你也太耐打了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1056_043nor", "source_sha256": "71bb551b03bda05cf4340d57d44ce7c6be9fc871173b92e4ba03dda20101bd6d", "ja": "ぐっ……けど効いたよ、ジュリア……充填、完了！\nうおおっ、フルパワーで行くぞーっ！", "zh": "呃……不过还是有效果的，茱莉亚……充能完毕！\n呜哦哦，接下来要全力上了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1057_verotyoro", "source_sha256": "3262b16744b786252b28e9fef6104805436821a8129575f508670460f6ddcb70", "ja": "ヴェロロッ！", "zh": "冲呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1058_039kon", "source_sha256": "83a8f8fb6f5a303f43b16c89a2c52ad907012c19d3770abbf743efd5124b9b18", "ja": "ああっ、ヴェロチョロが春香ちゃんの盾に！？\nこのままじゃ届かないわ！", "zh": "啊啊，维罗乔罗变成春香的盾牌了！？  \n这样下去就够不着了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1059_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f1fe5369d457068fe9c862a55b1fd149f15f606f54fb4ce6d7cd822c523d5bc1", "ja": "目が覚めたら、なんかハードな状況みたいだけど……\nあー、えっと……あのカエルを止めたらいいの？", "zh": "醒过来一看，好像陷入了不得了的状况……\n啊——那个，呃……只要阻止那只青蛙就行了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1060_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2bf66d2a550a19606217dcd6766f3de19d465ebb8c6cfbe4d2309b18039ba6f5", "ja": "ひとつ貸しにしとくよ、のり子！\nレッツダンス、『タイニー・ディスコ』！", "zh": "这次就算我帮你一个忙了，法子！\n一起跳舞吧，《Tiny Disco》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1061_verotyoro", "source_sha256": "47f71d04df2613642c059c3876be37925a2b263ae6ef11b1d94518fc93d98cd5", "ja": "ヴェロッ！？　ヴェロ……♪　ヴェロッ♪", "zh": "贝洛！？贝洛……♪贝洛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1062_043nor", "source_sha256": "c74757b081697348105299b2ee576face4378492a79d9481f8a0b7a99b74718f", "ja": "歩！？　ははっ……よおぉーしっ！\nこれが、アタシたちの……全力だーっ！！！！", "zh": "步！？哈哈……好——！\n这就是我们的……全力——！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1063_se", "source_sha256": "2f18e28c396c7b30cda17511592b935521b1754ad5571b755ba0d6ad30f21458", "ja": "ドッゴオォォォンッ！！！！", "zh": "轰隆隆隆！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1064_001har", "source_sha256": "a28f9a40115eb6b7595ca0aeaecfee4874274a3223967bcc8d23b71a96a6e2bd", "ja": "……すごい。障壁に穴が空いちゃった。\nパンチでどうにかなるものじゃないはずなんだけど。", "zh": "……好厉害。结界居然被打穿了个洞。\n明明按理说绝不是靠拳头就能解决的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1065_043nor", "source_sha256": "297bb4e2eca80958c2e69cafeeb6dcee65b36c19c5021515d6e5cf6cc122b962", "ja": "くっ！？　貫通しなかった！？　そんな……！", "zh": "呃！？居然没能贯穿！？怎么会……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1066_005yay", "source_sha256": "23b6fe8226922440ca9d163f2f11bb40bd438ad3615c283e69a89035879bad0e", "ja": "……。ジュリアさん！　私、ちょっと思い出したかも？\nジュリアさんがしてくれたこと。", "zh": "……。茱莉亚先生！我好像想起了一点什么？\n茱莉亚先生为我做过的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1067_050jul", "source_sha256": "a090a6b01748b43de65b3448a65b9e679c6499b1f3f8ca1837a2f41e012bcf97", "ja": "ヤッコ……！\nって、えっ！？　なんだ、それ？　弓矢？", "zh": "亚子……！\n等等，咦！？那是什么？弓箭？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1068_005yay", "source_sha256": "2da54385e722d55485fe660d10877be7b7366d520aff59a2e1edf857dab71379", "ja": "多分、私の戦具です！　ジュリアさんのことを\n思い出したら、心がポカポカしてきて……", "zh": "我想这应该就是我的战具了！一想起茱莉亚先生，\n心里就暖洋洋的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1069_005yay", "source_sha256": "08d9b6684505ffbe1c5091944e675cbec0170d6a48e72fe25ae44dba54c9aca2", "ja": "このポカポカを、春香さんにも分けてあげたいなーって\n思ったら、出てきちゃいました！", "zh": "我想把这份暖意也分给春香小姐，于是它就自己跑出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1070_050jul", "source_sha256": "72da5ac238b8892f68ac8a8db1f6ac4db6e0c09d30f0109f24bb2b0a51f0cf5b", "ja": "そっか……うん、ハルに教えてやれよ。\nヤッコが決めるなら、どうなったって文句ないぜ。", "zh": "这样啊……嗯，告诉小春吧。\n既然是亚子决定的，不管结果怎样我都没意见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1071_005yay", "source_sha256": "ec55ae135cf47a221b0a67826f7aaaca334fe105f3f0d247fdac17729e4abc12", "ja": "うっうー！　春香さん、受け取ってくださいーっ！", "zh": "呜呜——！春香姐姐，请接住——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1072_se", "source_sha256": "3fd8b99bb3337806c60415e24d27d15cd6110e9a457ef44836dd5f0d1392d69f", "ja": "シュバッ……トスッ。", "zh": "唰……咚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1073_001har", "source_sha256": "ea1f889855db520851267150e8d8ed0d1348b679209b02fd84a00a82a293441c", "ja": "っ！？　……ああ、これは……ふふっ。\n心を矢にして打ち込む能力かぁ……やよいらしいな。", "zh": "呃！？……啊啊，这是……呵呵。\n把心化作箭射出去的能力啊……真像弥生的风格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1074_001har", "source_sha256": "fc6d8ce70062c893ccaf7913058645fe3af5120a395ddd2d4e60c6c2289a544f", "ja": "戦具は、心の形。やよいはちゃんと、普通の女の子に\nなれたんだね。よかった……。", "zh": "战具，就是内心的形态。弥生终于好好地成为普通的女孩子了呢。太好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1075_001har", "source_sha256": "d27baa25629395a5a87554f7829538174667334dcddac756024f4bacaea713e2", "ja": "みんなの勝ち。こんなにあったかい心のままじゃ、\n私は公正な審判ができない。『大忘却』は停止するね。", "zh": "是大家赢了。带着这么温暖的心意，\n我是没办法做出公正审判的。“大忘却”就此停止吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_05_1076_001har", "source_sha256": "3373ddef348192721546bbf51c74dc078ef2f764323a7f5bfadfd38c564fe10d", "ja": "でも、覚えておいて。これからは、過酷な\n戦いが待ってる……みんなの武運を、祈ってるよ。", "zh": "但是，请记住。今后等待着大家的，将是残酷的战斗……我祈愿大家武运昌隆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
